                                "sense_id": "3d70c080-1897-3874-a9e8-863acfef65f8",
                                "text": "— Не постига́ю! сиде́ли ми́рно, соверше́нно ти́хо, заку́сывали…",
                                "translation": "‘I can’t conceive why! We were sitting there peacefully, perfectly quiet, having a bite to eat...’",
